  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento de la Gestin de los Recursos Pblicos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Public Resource Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El prstamo espera apoyar la mejora de polticas en seis reas: (i) gerenciamiento macroeconmico, (ii) gestin del gasto pblico (iii) gestin de los recursos humanos; (iv) auditora y control fiscal; (v) rentas internas, y (vi) aduanas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loan expect to improve policies in six areas: (i) macroeconomic management, (ii) public expenditure management, (iii) Human resources management; (iv) auditing and fiduciary oversight, and (v) internal revenue, and (vi) Customs.</narrative>
  </description>
